\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces PriVoke's three data paths separate local prompt inspection, supplied training examples and randomized reporting. ALLOW and WARN release the original body to the hosted LLM. Native messaging manages the bridge/runtime, while analysis uses loopback gRPC-Web. Separate services supply versioned weights and collect randomized event fields. Training uses neither intercepted prompts nor telemetry; dashed lines show lifecycle control.}}{3}{figure.9}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:architecture}{{1}{3}{PriVoke's three data paths separate local prompt inspection, supplied training examples and randomized reporting. ALLOW and WARN release the original body to the hosted LLM. Native messaging manages the bridge/runtime, while analysis uses loopback gRPC-Web. Separate services supply versioned weights and collect randomized event fields. Training uses neither intercepted prompts nor telemetry; dashed lines show lifecycle control}{figure.9}{}}
